---
import ProjectLayout from '../../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import HeroImage from '../../../assets/writing/sprytna-league.png';
---

<ProjectLayout
	title="Sprytna League"
	tagline="A season-long fantasy prediction game — guess your team's final score each week."
	heroImage={HeroImage}
	liveUrl="https://sprytnaleague.com"
	liveLabel="Request an invite"
	writingHref="/writing/sprytna-league/"
>
	<p>No drafting, no weekly lineups — just skin in the game each week. Pick your favorite team for the season, guess a score, and score points if you guessed under (or exactly) what your team achieved.</p>
	<p>Each league has a live score tracker and a projected score for each team, powered by <a href="https://the-odds-api.com">the odds API</a>.</p>
</ProjectLayout>
